        "original_id": "9d68f274-2958-5a9f-a36d-8a253c0a0903",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Pete Sell, Matt Serra, Ray Bronx Longo\n- Places: Garden City, East Meadow, Hempstead, Nassau County, New York, United States\n- Companies: TIAS.com\n- Roles: mixed martial artist, Brazilian Jiu Jitsu black belt, striking coach\n\nFacts:\n- TIAS.com was founded in 1995 and is based in Garden City, New York.\n- Pete Sell was born on August 5, 1982.\n- Pete Sell is an American mixed martial artist who specializes in Brazilian Jiu Jitsu.\n- Pete Sell is a black belt under Matt Serra, who is his teacher and a fellow mixed martial artist, in East Meadow, New York.\n- Pete Sell trained extensively under striking coach Ray Bronx Longo in Garden City, New York.\n- Garden City is an incorporated village in the town of Hempstead in central Nassau County, New York, United States.",
